flowchart TD
  S[Canonical source files] --> P[UTF-8 safe Parser]
  P --> M[Complete reachable module graph]
  M --> A[Each module resolves its own imports and aliases]
  A --> IR[Core IR with declaration to file metadata]
  IR --> N[Native parity]
  IR --> W[Packed WASM SDK]
  W --> J[Node compileFiles and inspect]
  W --> B[Browser worker]
  N --> T[Regression and compatibility gates]
  J --> T
  B --> T
